    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Parisa G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118018417532548616678/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIHuafRuS6774eu6ipbNsrNQjmnq0PtjBRGlikHQitgzt7W0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I had an urgent problem with my son and was desperate to find someone to help him because he wasn’t feeling well. I went to GMF Vaudreuil-Dorion without an appointment, and I have to say the service I received was truly wonderful.\n\nThe receptionist was absolutely amazing—so kind, understanding, and compassionate. She went out of her way to make sure we could be seen. Thanks to her, we saw a nurse right away, and the nurse was also very caring and professional. To our good fortune, there had been a cancellation, and my son was able to see the doctor the same day.\n\nThe doctor was thorough, kind, and reassuring. My son’s issues—nose bleeding and an eye infection—were treated, and I left with peace of mind.\n\nI am so grateful to the whole team for their kindness and professionalism. They truly went above and beyond, and I highly recommend this clinic to everyone. God bless them for the work they do!",
        "time": 1759501913,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emilie Lawson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118429728064989492785/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0QrgJC4Rsi1aq8AL9wEl1poC337vJb9j9rsPcj37DkSkU_lnu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing service always from nurse Sonia and Dr Turnblom. I always feel respected, listened to, and cared for by the staff. Best medical experience a girl could ever ask for, especially after the horrible, degrading experience I had elsewhere.",
        "time": 1759132302,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sharon Peloquin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112591215457015719245/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMwnM_EgsidiA1jtORENxSOpz7YmbFSC2px-BM8ngzz6_bNjCm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "After seeing a Dr the week before, I realized that I neglected to mention something crucial to him that made it crucial that I see a neurologist urgently.  I made another appointment only to have been crudely served by Dr. K. Rodriguez. who didn't even give me a referral for a prosthesis to keep me safe from falling, or an MRI,  CT scan or x-ray, she didn't even look at my problem, examin me in anyway.  I had to almost argue for the Neurologist's referral, a true waste of time and tax money.  She even cancelled the appointment I had for the following week with the doctor that had results he had asked for against my wishes.  I had seen this person before and noted a true lack of concern or apathy that we expect in a care giver, let alone a doctor.",
        "time": 1756242878,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noozah Ansari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154741293603635240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTPUdj3KDYl13D4t1QYBe876CJIWHM9Iczegn0xKnq7-jl1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Worst clinic and the worst secretaries. JUST TO MAKE AN APPOINTMENT WITH YOUR OWN FAMILY DOCTOR IT TAKES MONTHS. No one ever answers. When you go to the clinic, they hand you a card to make appointments online. Guess what it's a new way for making money. As it recommends to start paying to make sure you're getting an appointment. SO MUCH FOR FREE MEDICARE.",
        "time": 1753407370,
        "translated": false
      },
